{"id":"fa5a4ce6b6982a00","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence.md","title":"Kleene Equivalence Theorem","display":"thm-kleene-regular-expression-equivalence — Kleene Equivalence Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence","73-thm-kleene-regular-expression-equivalence"],"display":"thm-kleene-regular-expression-equivalence — Kleene Equivalence Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-thm-nfa-determinization]]","[[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence</span><span>73-thm-kleene-regular-expression-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-regular-expression-equivalence — Kleene Equivalence Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dca22faafaee72fb\" href=\"?note=dca22faafaee72fb\" title=\"73-thm-nfa-determinization\">73-thm-nfa-determinization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c045448153929107\" href=\"?note=c045448153929107\" title=\"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination\">73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (regular languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (regular-expression syntax and semantics, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d47feb8e4b903a2e\" href=\"?note=d47feb8e4b903a2e\" title=\"73-df-regex-denotation\">73-df-regex-denotation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\;\nL=\\llbracket E\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\;\nL=\\llbracket E\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thompson's structural construction maps each regular expression to an equivalent epsilon-NFA; <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c045448153929107\" href=\"?note=c045448153929107\" title=\"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination\">73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dca22faafaee72fb\" href=\"?note=dca22faafaee72fb\" title=\"73-thm-nfa-determinization\">73-thm-nfa-determinization</a> then give a DFA.</li>\n<li>Conversely, state elimination on a finite automaton produces a regular expression. Both directions preserve the language at every construction step.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-denotation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-nfa-determinization","status":"resolved","id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-nfa-determinization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"c045448153929107","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular languages, see [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regex-denotation","status":"resolved","id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}$ and $\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}$ (regular-expression syntax and semantics, see [[73-df-regex-denotation]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"c045448153929107","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Thompson's structural construction maps each regular expression to an equivalent epsilon-NFA; [[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination]] and [[73-thm-nfa-determinization]] then give a DFA.","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-nfa-determinization","status":"resolved","id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Thompson's structural construction maps each regular expression to an equivalent epsilon-NFA; [[73-thm-epsilon-transition-elimination]] and [[73-thm-nfa-determinization]] then give a DFA.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\llbracket\\cdot\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\;\nL=\\llbracket E\\rrbracket_{\\Sigma}\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1467,"backlinks":[{"id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a3e9abfe7826975a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正则表达式—自动机对应见 [[73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence]]；用其语义像对应本条目的语言代数。"}],"outgoing":["d47feb8e4b903a2e","c284ffb568a496fd","dca22faafaee72fb","c045448153929107"]}